militia-operation-desant-name = Operation Silent Hull
militia-operation-desant-description = An observation post detected a brief engine burn from an assault vessel. Identification requests went unanswered. Intelligence reports an armed Rassvet team carrying sealed orders. Board the vessel and seize its documents.
militia-operation-science-name = Operation Closed Experiment
militia-operation-science-description = External sensors detected an undeclared research platform. Intercepted traffic suggests a Rassvet technical cell is aboard. Neutralize the guards and recover the group's working documents.
militia-operation-cargo-name = Operation Special Cargo
militia-operation-cargo-description = Intelligence identified a cargo vessel used for illicit Rassvet supply runs. Its identification signal ceased near the station. Seize its route documents and establish the intended recipients.
militia-operation-flagship-name = Operation Broken Link
militia-operation-flagship-description = Intercepted transmissions revealed a large vessel believed to serve as a Rassvet command relay. Expect substantial armed resistance. Board the vessel and seize the sealed headquarters documents.
militia-operation-evidence-received = Evidence transferred to investigators.
